flowchart LR
    C[Configured provider and model] --> A{Production adapter exists?}
    A -- no --> U[unimplemented]
    A -- yes --> L[model_loading]
    L -->|dependency missing or unreachable| V[unavailable]
    L -->|probe rejects or returns invalid inference| F[failed]
    L -->|preload plus governed inference succeeds| R[ready]
    V --> L
    F --> L
    R -->|subsequent health check| L
    U --> N[not communication-eligible]
    V --> N
    F --> N
    L --> N
    R --> E[communication-eligible]
